# Completed TODO archive

Append-only history of finished [`TODO.md`](TODO.md) items. Every 3 days,
`tools/archive-completed-todo.mjs` (run by the
`com.kevinkhanhle.sensebridge-archive-completed-todo` launchd job — see
[`docs/TOOLING.md`](docs/TOOLING.md)) moves everything out of TODO.md's
`## Completed` section into a new `## Archived <date>` block here, so the
working file stays short. Read TODO.md for anything still open; this file is
reference only.

