        (`claude-api`, `hyperframes`, `dataviz`, `impeccable`, `task-observer`);
        those cost far more than a one-line row.
      - **claude.ai account connectors are still attached.** The 16:44 pass
        removed *user-scoped* servers from `~/.claude.json` but not the account
        connectors, which are the item flagged `[P1]` in the "Config dedupe"
        section below and remain undone. Confirmed present this session:
        ElevenLabs, Granola, Sentry, Supabase, Vercel — ~100 deferred tool names
        between them, and Supabase ships a multi-paragraph instruction block
        that loads regardless of `ENABLE_TOOL_SEARCH`.
      - **The agent-type roster** (~35 agents, each with a description) and the
        two inlined skill bodies (`superpowers:using-superpowers`, `ponytail`
        at full intensity) are fixed per-session costs nothing in the audit
        addressed.
      - **A duplicate `SessionStart` hook had regressed** and was echoing
        `tmp/handoff.md` twice — fixed this session, see the entry in the
        "Config dedupe" section.

      **Next lever, in order of expected size:** disconnect the claude.ai
      connectors (already the `[P1]` below), then prune plugins rather than
      individual skills. Re-measure with the per-session method above, not the
      25-session mean.

